+# PocketJS vendor provenance
+
+This directory is a nested Git checkout, not a subtree tracked by the parent
+bsky-vita Git index. Its upstream source identity is PocketJS commit
+`1c248fb18f976e91a313f11e0dbb35273c9e48dd` (MIT), from
+`https://github.com/pocket-nexus/pocketjs`.
+
+The parent workspace records the approved modifications as patch files under
+`pocket-ui/vendor-patches/`, each named by its path beneath this directory.
+Recreate this checkout with `pocket-ui/scripts/bootstrap-pocketjs.sh`, which
+fetches this revision and applies the patches without resetting an existing
+checkout. Verify the result with `git -C vendor/pocketjs diff --check` and the
+nested checkout's status. The parent Git index does not preserve untracked
+content from this nested checkout; keep the bootstrap script and complete
+patch inventory in sync when updating the approved source.
+
+The Vita program's QuickJS binding is pinned in
+`programs/vita/Cargo.toml` to git revision
+`ba5bdd0dc013518768e76cd9e05cd30ed53dd35b`. Host builds of the bridge use the
+same Cargo-fetched Git object, verify its exact commit and tree identity, and
+compile its embedded QuickJS sources. Run `cargo fetch` before Rust builds if
+the pinned object is not cached; no build script downloads dependencies.
